    hotelsTitle: '🗺 Hotels',
    transportTitle: '🗺 Transport',
    transportDaily: '🚐 Daily transport',
    ferryTitle: '⛴️ Ferry – Amalfi Coast',
    guideSuggestionsHeading: 'Guide Suggestions',
    guideSuggestionsText: 'Add a walking tour along the ancient city walls of Lecce, including a visit to the <strong>Mura Urbiche</strong>, one of the most representative historic spaces in the city.',
    day3GuideSuggestionsHeading: 'Guide Suggestions',
    day3GuideSuggestionsText: 'In addition to visiting <strong>Otranto</strong>, I suggest a stop at the <strong>Punta Palascia Lighthouse</strong>, the easternmost point of Italy. It lies practically on the planned route, so it can be added to this excursion very easily without significantly changing the program.',
    day4GuideSuggestionsHeading: 'Guide Suggestions',
    day4GuideSuggestionsText: 'Add a stop in <strong>Galatina</strong> to visit the <strong>Basilica of Santa Caterina d\'Alessandria</strong>, a masterpiece of extraordinary artistic value, famous for its impressive late Gothic interior completely covered with frescoes.',
    day5GuideSuggestionsHeading: 'Guide Suggestions',
    day5GuideSuggestionsText: 'During the route to <strong>Polignano a Mare</strong>, we could include a visit to the <strong>Abbazia di Cerrate</strong>, a magnificent example of Apulian Romanesque architecture surrounded by ancient olive groves.<br><br>We could also consider a <strong>boat tour</strong> departing from <strong>Polignano a Mare</strong> or from <strong>Monopoli</strong> to enjoy the coastline from the sea.',
    day6GuideSuggestionsHeading: 'Guide Suggestions',
    day6GuideSuggestionsText: 'I would prefer to keep this day free of additional scheduled activities, leaving it open to include spontaneous plans or to address special requests that may arise from the group during the trip.',
    day7GuideSuggestionsHeading: 'Guide Suggestions',
    day7GuideSuggestionsText: 'In addition to visiting <strong>Martina Franca</strong> and <strong>Locorotondo</strong>, I suggest including a <strong>wine tasting</strong> to discover the region\'s wine tradition and get to know native varieties such as <strong>Primitivo</strong> and <strong>Negroamaro</strong> in a typical and traditional setting.',
    day8GuideSuggestionsHeading: 'Guide Suggestions',
    day8GuideSuggestionsText: 'As a closing experience for the Puglia stage, we could include a <strong>premium extra virgin olive oil tasting</strong> in an authentic <strong>frantoio ipogeo</strong>, an ancient underground olive mill of great historical value, where the group can learn about the traditional production process and taste some of the best oils in the region.',
