    day13TransferTitle: '🚐 Final transfer',
    day13TransferCard: '<h3>🚐 Final transfer</h3><p><strong>Transfer distance:</strong> Approximately 298 km<br><strong>Total driving time:</strong> 3h30–4h depending on Rome traffic<br><strong>Walking distance:</strong> Minimal<br><strong>Terrain:</strong> Flat hotel/airport urban access<br><strong>Activity duration:</strong> Transfer and departure day</p><p>Morning departure from Sorrento.<br>Private transfer to Rome.</p><p>Estimated transfer time:<br>3h30 – 4h depending on traffic.</p>',
    day13FinalTourTitle: '🎯 End of our tour',
    day13FinalTourCard: '<h3>🎯 End of our tour</h3><p>Objective of the day:<br>✔ Smooth conclusion<br>✔ Minimal stress<br>✔ Comfortable pacing</p>',
    day13ConclusionsTitle: '✨ Conclusions and achievements?',
    day13ConclusionsCard: '<h3>✨ Conclusions and achievements?</h3><p>Objectives pursued during our tour:<br>✔ Comfort<br>✔ Authenticity<br>✔ Scenic beauty<br>✔ Local experiences<br>✔ Relaxed rhythm<br>✔ Shared memories with friends</p>',
    day5WeatherLink: '🌤 Check Polignano weather',
    day5BaseCard: '<h3 data-i18n="newBaseHeading">🏨 New Base</h3><p><strong>Cala Ponte Hotel – Tribute Portfolio (Marriott)</strong><br>San Vito, Polignano a Mare, Bari 70044</p>',
    day5MapCard: '<h3 data-i18n="day5MapHeading">🗺️ Route map</h3><img id="mapa-image" src="images/mapaEdia5.jpg" alt="Route map" style="width: 100%; max-width: 900px; height: auto; border: 0; border-radius: 10px;" loading="lazy">',
    day5MorningCard: '<h3>🌅 MORNING - ARRIVAL + FIRST CONTACT WITH THE COAST</h3><p><strong>10:00 - Departure from Lecce</strong><br>Luggage loaded in advance.</p><p>✔ Optional technical stop on the highway (10 min).</p><hr><p><strong>11:45 - Arrival at Cala Ponte Hotel</strong></p><p>• Unload luggage<br>• Check-in if available<br>• If not: leave bags and head out</p><hr><p><strong>12:00 - Departure to Polignano center</strong><br>🚐 10 min from the hotel</p>',
    day5IntroCard: '<h3 data-i18n="polignanoIntroHeading">🌊 POLIGNANO A MARE – GENTLE INTRO WALK</h3><p>Perfect after a transfer day.</p><hr><p><strong>12:15 – Lama Monachile</strong><br>⏱ 25 min</p><p>• Iconic bridge view<br>• Best light before noon</p><hr><p><strong>12:40 – Historic Center</strong><br>⏱ 50 min, easy walk</p><p>Circular route through key alleys and viewpoints.</p>',
    day5LunchCard: '<h3 data-i18n="lunchViewHeading">🍝 LUNCH WITH A VIEW</h3><p><strong>13:30 – Lunch</strong><br>Ideal duration: 1h45m</p>',
    day5SunsetCard: '<h3 data-i18n="sunsetOptionHeading">🌅 SUNSET OPTION (RECOMMENDED)</h3><p><strong>17:45 – Lungomare</strong><br>⏱ 40 min</p><p>Moderate 1 km walk to enjoy the Adriatic sunset.</p><hr><p><strong>18:45 – Panoramic aperitivo</strong></p><hr><p><strong>19:30 – Dinner</strong></p>',
    day5WalkingCard: '<h3 data-i18n="dayWalkingLevelHeading">🚶 WALKING LEVEL OF THE DAY</h3><p>🟢 Easy-moderate</p>',
    day5LogicCard: '<h3 data-i18n="dayLogicHeading">💡 STRATEGIC LOGIC OF THE DAY</h3><p>Short transfer, soft coastal introduction, comfortable check-in and energy saved for next days.</p>',
    day5ImportantCard: '<h3 data-i18n="importantHeading">🎯 IMPORTANT</h3><p>From this day on, Polignano becomes the base for Alberobello, Locorotondo, Martina Franca, Ostuni and Matera.</p>',
