    day6AiaPiccolaCard: '<h3 data-i18n="aiaPiccolaHeading">🌿 AIA PICCOLA (authentic area)</h3><p><strong>5️⃣ Rione Aia Piccola</strong><br>12:00 – 13:00</p><p>Residential, quieter and very photogenic.</p>',
