    day2Heading: '<p>🔵 Giorno 2 (mercoledì, 21 Ott) – <a class="poi-link" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g616186-d4563506-Reviews-Valle_d_Itria-Martina_Franca_Province_of_Taranto_Puglia.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lecce Valle d’Itria</a></p>',
    day3Heading: '<p>🟣 Giorno 3 (giovedì, 22 Ott) – <a class="poi-link" href="https://www.google.com/search?q=Otranto&kgmid=/m/014mjr&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwixiKzbyv6RAxW3L0QIHVPAA5kQ3egRegQIBxA9" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Otranto e la costa adriatica</a></p>',
